uzNumber":21,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":351,"MaqraNumber":162,"HizbNumber":41,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":30,"SurahIndex":"030","VerseNumber":25,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمِنۡ ءَايَٰتِهِۦٓ أَن تَقُومَ ٱلسَّمَآءُ وَٱلۡأَرۡضُ بِأَمۡرِهِۦۚ ثُمَّ إِذَا دَعَاكُمۡ دَعۡوَةٗ مِّنَ ٱلۡأَرۡضِ إِذَآ أَنتُمۡ تَخۡرُجُونَ","TajweedText":"وَمِنْ ءَايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِۦٓ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ت</tajweed>َقُومَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءُ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضُ بِأَمْرِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed>‌ۚ ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ إِذَا دَعَاكُمْ دَعْوَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ إِذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed>ُمْ تَخْرُج<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٥</span>","End":"٢٥","PageNumber":407,"JuzNumber":21,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":351,"MaqraNumber":162,"HizbNumber":41,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":30,"SurahIndex":"030","VerseNumber":26,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَهُۥ مَن فِي ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِۖ كُلّٞ لَّهُۥ قَٰنِتُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ف</tajweed>ِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ‌ۖ كُ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>لٌّ ل</tajweed>َّهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> قَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نِت<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٢٦</span>","End":"٢٦","PageNumber":407,"JuzNumber":21,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber